Spec: SpecDD Workflow Overlay

Purpose:
  Add deterministic SpecDD lifecycle enforcement to the installed Spec Kit workflow without modifying generated workflow state.

Owns:
  ./workflow-overlay.yml

References:
  ./scripts/workflow_gate.sdd

Must:
  The overlay extends the installed `speckit` workflow through supported step edits.
  Planning context runs after the base `plan` step.
  Task boundary refresh and validation run after the base `tasks` step.
  Implementation authorization runs before the base `implement` step without refreshing the authority snapshot.
  Actual-change verification runs after the base `implement` step.
  Structural gate steps use shell execution so deterministic nonzero status halts the workflow by default.
  Structural gate shell steps report missing `uv` as an infrastructure failure before bridge execution.
  Structural gate shell steps invoke runtime from installed extension state rather than canonical bridge-development paths.
  Agent lifecycle hooks remain separate from structural workflow enforcement.

Must not:
  Patch the installed base workflow under `.specify/`.
  Set `continue_on_error` on a structural SpecDD gate.

Done when:
  Workflow resolution places context, task validation, authorization, and verification around the intended base steps.
